{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:48 2026-11-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:48 2026-11-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:48 2026-11-03 HKT</p><img alt=\"九龍塘廣播道單位起火冒煙 消防趕至拖喉救熄\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d20f2c03c256b807283f57bbfe88f73/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_15_41_42.jpeg\"/><p>九龍塘廣播道42號一單位，今日（11月3日）下午3時許起火，懷疑燒着雜物冒出黑煙，多名住戶疏散。消防接報趕至，動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊，迅速將火救熄。火警中暫未有受傷報告，目前起因仍在調查。</p><img alt=\"現場為九龍塘廣播道42號一單位。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a87fcdf71674e30e641b382ebc4372c4/2026-11/gwong.jpeg\" title=\"現場為九龍塘廣播道42號一單位。讀者提供\"/><p>現場為九龍塘廣播道42號一單位。讀者提供</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:02:11.562862+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:48:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:58.924928+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:58.924928+00:00","content_hash":"b2a18b31f6777d44b77c19a0c5a8b9e4ffa2434bbec992de426e32b3dd3eabaf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}